<contentList>
  <content contentuid="hb7a566f8g12bbg54a7g9799gdf824a9d1f09" version="1">Delegate Turn</content>
  <content contentuid="h44dda104gc75cg5072g9e3ag26deae35fb4c" version="1">Let the game's combat AI take this companion's turns until combat ends or you recall them.</content>
  <content contentuid="h5fe52b53ged31g519fg996fg95f40ed849a4" version="1">Resume Manual Control</content>
  <content contentuid="ha554d990ged47g55d5g888egf2db44c7ae30" version="1">Take back control of this companion on their next available turn.</content>
  <content contentuid="h47d3d59eg62deg5694gaf5aga41f11ff8a1e" version="1">Acting Independently</content>
  <content contentuid="h850bc83dgd6bbg5792g8936gf474fc184ce4" version="1">The combat AI chooses the actions of this companion.</content>
  <content contentuid="hfd643988g3b1eg5e21gabb7g2e15782ecbd5" version="1">Tactician's Ring</content>
  <content contentuid="h4a200f87g7e0fg545cg9a09g956e6371b28b" version="1">Equip this ring to delegate combat turns to companions and take back control.</content>
